      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE STORY: Every month, Experian sends a big credit data file.\nCreditOne bank needs to receive it, validate it, parse it, and store it.\nThese 15 database tables configure that entire pipeline.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE STORY: Every month, Experian sends a big credit data file.\nCreditOne bank needs to receive it, validate it, parse it, and store it.\nThese 15 database tables configure that entire pipeline.",
